sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User (Browser)
    participant Fn as Netlify Function
    participant S as Stripe
    participant DB as Supabase Postgres

    U->>Fn: POST /api/checkout (authenticated session)
    Fn->>Fn: Rate limit; validate plan against server-side price map
    Fn->>S: Find-or-create customer (search by email first)
    Fn->>S: Create Checkout Session (metadata: supabase_user_id)
    S-->>Fn: Session URL
    Fn-->>U: Redirect to Stripe-hosted Checkout
    U->>S: Completes payment on Stripe's page
    S-->>Fn: Webhook: checkout.session.completed (signed)
    Fn->>Fn: Verify signature via constructEvent; reject invalid with generic 400
    Fn->>DB: Write subscription/entitlement (idempotent)
    DB-->>Fn: OK
    Fn-->>S: 200 (return 500 on failure so Stripe retries)
